  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Datatek - Ankara</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Datatek</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Barn med funktionshinder &#xe4;r en mycket utsatt grupp i Turkiet. Det finns mycket lite hj&#xe4;lp att f&#xe5; och dessutom &#xe4;r handikapp i sig stigmatiserat. Syftet med denna insats &#xe4;r att presentera vissa tekniker som kan anv&#xe4;ndas f&#xf6;r lek och habilitering av gravt  funktionshindrade barn. En utst&#xe4;llning kommer att h&#xe5;llas i Ankara under maj/juni, samt seminarier och workshops.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Disabled children is a very vulnerable group in Turkey. There is almost no support to parents and people working with disabled children. This small project aims to show some technologies that are being used in Sweden for training and play of disabled children. The exhibition will take place in Ancara in May/June. During the exhibition seminars and a workshop will be hold.</narrative>
  </description>
